  ],
  "kind": "bit-matching-detail",
  "title": "ODDFYIELD checks frequency before basis, starts from par-100 seed, and stops Newton when |step| <= 1e-10 before updating",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0.20527, ODDFYIELD validates frequency before reading optional basis, rejects zero date serials and unaligned first_coupon dates (requiring COUPPCD(first_coupon, maturity, freq, basis) == first_coupon) with #NUM!, allows negative yields while 1 + y/freq > 0, starts from a schedule-free par-100 seed y_0, and runs up to 100 Newton iterations on ODDFPRICE using the regular-coupon derivative (omitting the first-period DFC/E factor), returning the iterate BEFORE updating when |step| <= 1e-10 (or y_100).",
  "status": "measured",
  "basis": "Measured in Excel 16.0.20527.20088 across dcztvv_r23 (50 rows), dcztvv_r24 (36 rows), prefix_metadata (row 375), 250/250 holdout rows, and 2,952/2,952 full-bank ODDFYIELD rows.",
